@startuml
title А5. RabbitMQ topology: producers, consumers, DLX/DLQ
scale max 1600*900
left to right direction
component "Switch\nLoggerClient" as sw
queue "smp.transactions\n(topic, durable)" as txex
queue "transaction-log\ndurable; x-max-delivery=3" as txq
component "TransactionLogListener" as txconsumer
database "PostgreSQL\ntransactions" as txdb
queue "smp.transactions.dlx\n(direct, durable)" as txdlx
queue "transaction-log-dlq\ndurable; TTL 60s" as txdlq
database "PostgreSQL\noutbox_event" as outdb
component "Card Management\nOutboxEventProcessorImpl" as outbox
queue "smp.card-events\n(topic, durable)" as cardex
queue "card-notifications\ndurable; x-max-delivery=3" as cardq
component "CardEventListener" as cardconsumer
database "PostgreSQL\ncard_notifications" as notifdb
queue "smp.card-events.dlx\n(direct, durable)" as carddlx
queue "card-notifications-dlq\ndurable; TTL 60s" as carddlq
sw ..> txex : TransactionRequest; routing key transaction.log
txex ..> txq : bind transaction.log
txq ..> txconsumer : AMQP delivery
txconsumer --> txdb : save transaction
txq --> txdlx : exhausted/rejected delivery\nrouting key transaction-log
txdlx --> txdlq : bind transaction-log
outdb --> outbox : read PENDING events
outbox ..> cardex : CardEvent; routing key card.<EventClass>
cardex ..> cardq : bind card.*
cardq ..> cardconsumer : AMQP delivery
cardconsumer --> notifdb : save notification
cardq --> carddlx : exhausted/rejected delivery\nrouting key card-notifications
carddlx --> carddlq : bind card-notifications
note bottom
Publisher: Switch config sets CORRELATED confirms; assignment/docs claim
2s timeout and rollback after missing confirm. Current LoggerClient calls
convertAndSend but does not explicitly await CorrelationData; confirm-to-
rollback path should be validated against implementation.

Queues are durable; code declares x-max-delivery=3, DLX bindings, and
DLQ TTL=60,000ms. Actual retry/redelivery semantics also depend on listener
container/broker setup. Outbox has a separate max retry count 3 and marks
failure after exhausting publish retries; these are not consumer redeliveries.
Sources: switch/config/RabbitMQConfig.java; transaction-logger/config/
RabbitMQConfig.java; card-management/config/RabbitMQConfig.java;
notification/config/RabbitMQConfig.java; card-management/services/
OutboxEventProcessorImpl.java.
end note
@enduml
